    {
      "id": "p1",
      "text": "Visionary leader Sasan Goodarzi has unveiled a bold AI transformation plan, aiming to pioneer AI-powered product evolution. The innovation-driven company is streamlining its operations, consolidating teams to focus on new frontiers and strategically realigning resources. This major shift will involve a significant workforce reallocation, with approximately 3,000 roles being eliminated to enhance agility. To support the transition, the company is offering generous severance packages to its U.S. employees and is consolidating operations by winding down offices in Reno and Woodland Hills, moving toward central innovation hubs.",
